# generic.rules — the default vmxplore ruleset on a non-kldload host.
#
# Read by rules.go when no kldload is detected and no --rules/-r override or
# /etc/vmxplore/rules exists. Only job: keep automated snapshot noise out of
# the ✎ count. Anything unmatched is class "human" (an operator made it).
# No group rules — without a site naming convention every domain is its own
# story, so all land in "ungrouped". Copy this file to /etc/vmxplore/rules
# and add `group <regex> <label>` lines to teach vmx your convention.

snap noise autosnap_
snap noise auto-
snap noise zfs-auto-snap
snap noise syncoid_
snap noise znap_
